& [PortionSliceMapV1] is the slice-ready whole-pie decomposition map for LangSOP
  + [map_state] is P6_surface_implementation_activation_minted_ready_for_P6-IA01
  + [slice_policy] is portions bake the whole product; slice families divide portions; slices are minted just in time from readiness
  + [rebake_trigger] is source change, authority change, portion boundary change, completed-work delta, stale support, false-ready slice, new safety risk, or implementation contradiction

  = must: load this map before minting LangSOP development slices
  = must: update this map after completed work changes support or requirements
  = must: keep blocked portions visible but unsliced except for blocker-resolution or preparation work

& [Portion: P1SemanticAuthorityAndSourceLineage] is supported
  + [portion_id] is P1
  + [portion_name] is semantic authority and source lineage
  + [purpose] is preserve SOP source, SJS signatures, source snapshots, canonical authority, and soft-wire reconsideration
  + [dependency_set] is none for planning use
  + [support_record] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Initial_Workflow.v2.canonical.sop
  + [support_record] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_Whole_Pie_Working_Pattern.canonical.sop
  + [proof_route] is signature validation over source manifests and satisfaction signatures
  + [surface_ref] is manager, narrative, debug, and worker packet authority notices
  + [slice_family] is source-preservation-and-signature-validation

  = must: remain loaded as authority context for every other portion

